#: src/lib/components/help/HelpDashboard.svelte
msgid "Nocturne uses the delta supplied with the newest sensor reading, or subtracts the previous sensor reading if no delta is supplied. Plus means the value increased. Minus means it decreased. Compare the reading times: the interval may be longer than five minutes."
